The files in this folder (tests/spim-oracle/) and the other SPIM 9.1.24 output kept in this
repository as test data (tests/disasm/*.txt, tests/asm/*.json, the images in tests/hmx/asm/,
tests/hmx/mips/ and tests/hmx/record/ with the start-up code of SPIM's exceptions.s, and
tests/hmx/hallym-mips-v2.4.0/*.regs) were produced by SPIM 9.1.24. They are test data only and
are not part of the distributed program. SPIM's license, as written in vendor/spim-9.1.24/README
before that folder was removed (D-141):

